# Stock & POS — frontend

Skill map: `.cursor/skills/stock-pos-build/frontend-map.md`

## Access & sync

- Use repositories/composables for API access; do not call APIs ad hoc from pages.
- Keep menu (`useMenu.ts`) + `stock-modules.ts` + `definePageMeta({ permission })` + `ROLE_DOCUMENT_TYPES` + i18n en/km aligned.
- Products live under `/stock`, not `/products`.

## Forbidden routes / UI

Do not ship or restore: Delivery Notes, UOM pages, Expired Stock, credit limit, min-stock/expiry columns or alerts, POS post-checkout Delivery Note, `deliveryFee` / `needsDelivery`.

## Forms & lists

- Product forms: single General tab — sale price on main form; profit % calculated; no UOM / min stock / expiry.
- Customer/Supplier forms: no credit limit; debt display read-only.
- Stock list: no expiry or minimum-stock columns; stock value at cost is OK.
- Dashboard: do not restore `lowStock` / `expiryLoss` / `pendingDeliveryNotes`.

## POS / purchases

- Line math from `~/utils/stock/line-calc` only — do not add new `uom-conversions` callers.
- POS cart: height / width / m² / qty; checkout field **`otherCharge`** → API `other_charge`.
- Purchase totals: **`otherCost`** → API `other_cost`.
- Print invoice must use `otherCharge`, not delivery fee.

## Cleanup targets (if touched)

- Delete mock `uoms` / `deliveryNotes` seed collections when safe.
- After removing UI, delete dead i18n keys for delivery/UOM/min-stock/expiry/credit-limit.
- Prefer shared report filter/toolbar/export components; statement/profit shells may stay thin until APIs exist.

## Tests

Keep `nav-allowlist`, `line-calc`, repositories, mock-repositories, and print-documents specs consistent with the allowlist and contracts above.
